Job Control Language (JCL)

//MYJOB   JOB (ACCT),'MY JOB',CLASS=A,MSGCLASS=X
//STEP1   EXEC PGM=IEFBR14
//SYSPRINT DD  SYSOUT=*

JCL defines: who runs it, what program, what data.

IEFBR14 is the 'do-nothing' program - it just sets RC=0.
Perfect for testing JCL syntax and job submission.
